WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.042
Look at these tunnels that

00:00:01.042 --> 00:00:03.128
Hamas uses to get its missiles.

00:00:03.128 --> 00:00:04.587
Hamas is this anti-Israeli

00:00:04.587 --> 00:00:06.464
militant group down in the Gaza Strip.

00:00:06.464 --> 00:00:07.549
It's a part of Palestine.

00:00:07.549 --> 00:00:09.801
Gaza is sandwiched between Egypt,

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:12.387
the ocean and Hamas's enemy, Israel.

00:00:12.387 --> 00:00:13.513
They're totally isolated

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:14.597
and blockaded from the world,

00:00:14.597 --> 00:00:15.765
and yet they still managed

00:00:15.765 --> 00:00:17.183
to get all of these rockets

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:18.601
that they shoot into Israel.

00:00:18.601 --> 00:00:19.728
These rockets and their parts

00:00:19.728 --> 00:00:21.104
mostly come from other countries

00:00:21.104 --> 00:00:22.480
like Iran and Syria.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:22.981
Historically,

00:00:22.981 --> 00:00:24.482
they've made their way into the country

00:00:24.482 --> 00:00:26.151
through this network of tunnels.

00:00:26.151 --> 00:00:27.736
Israel's always finding these tunnels

00:00:27.736 --> 00:00:28.695
and trying to shut them down.

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:30.739
But they certainly still exist.

00:00:30.739 --> 00:00:31.406
They also do this thing

00:00:31.406 --> 00:00:33.366
where a ship off shore will drop a floating

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:34.993
capsule full of weapons

00:00:34.993 --> 00:00:35.785
and it will be picked up

00:00:35.785 --> 00:00:37.454
by these scuba fighters.

00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:38.246
One way or another,

00:00:38.246 --> 00:00:39.289
they use these black market

00:00:39.289 --> 00:00:40.123
smuggling techniques

00:00:40.123 --> 00:00:41.666
to get these rockets into the country

00:00:41.666 --> 00:00:43.835
and they build up a huge arsenal

00:00:43.835 --> 00:00:44.794
and then they kind of release them

00:00:44.794 --> 00:00:45.420
all at once,

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:46.504
which is what they recently

00:00:46.504 --> 00:00:48.214
did starting this new war.

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:48.923
If you want to understand

00:00:48.923 --> 00:00:50.341
what's happening in this conflict,

00:00:50.341 --> 00:00:51.092
follow along for more.

00:00:51.092 --> 00:00:52.135
I'm going to be covering this.

